    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Yapori Show Maker is a story creation editor based on the animated series The Yapori Show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5 characters, each with different poses to use in this creation editor, such as Yapori, a green fox with a blue scarf; Darkpori, a black fox with a gray scarf; Chuck, a blue chicken; Jack, a yellow monkey; and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Texts to make the characters interact with each other, whether talking, fighting, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some different backgrounds to use in the creation editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brief tutorial to learn how to use the application.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Yapori Show Maker is a story creation editor based on the animated series The Yapori Show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5 characters, each with different poses to use in this creation editor, such as Yapori, a green fox with a blue scarf; Darkpori, a black fox with a gray scarf; Chuck, a blue chicken; Jack, a yellow monkey; and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Texts to make the characters interact with each other, whether talking, fighting, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some different backgrounds to use in the creation editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brief tutorial to learn how to use the application.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more.</p></li></ul>",
